## 7. Database Schema (v1.1 — Implemented)

Core entities: `Users`, `Courses`, `Notes`, `Tasks`, `RefreshTokens`, `AiUsageLogs`.

**Status: relational integrity is fully implemented and verified** — every relationship below exists as a real Foreign Key with a supporting index in PostgreSQL:

- `Courses.UserId → Users` (Restrict)
- `Notes.UserId → Users` (Restrict), `Notes.CourseId → Courses` (SetNull)
- `Tasks.UserId → Users` (Restrict), `Tasks.CourseId → Courses` (Restrict), `Tasks.SourceNoteId → Notes` (SetNull)
- `RefreshTokens.UserId → Users` (Cascade)
- `AiUsageLogs.UserId → Users` (Restrict)

Soft-delete implemented via `IsDeleted` + EF Core Global Query Filters on `Notes`, `Courses`, `Tasks`.

Full entity-relationship diagram: `docs/database/databaseERD` (Mermaid) and `docs/database/DataBaseERDv1.jfif`.

